        "id": 1314845
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-09-19T17:08:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In that case we\u0027ll need to add casts on all the calls where `r` is assigned:\n\n```\nr \u003d (libusb_error)libusb_init(NULL);\n```\n\nBoth options look ugly to me unfortunately.",
      "parentUuid": "43beefeb_dae54223",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 225,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 225,
        "endChar": 40
      },
      "revId": "26856267e2b74110208aa8e9344700109e90b38a",
