        "id": 1106949
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-09-19T17:30:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ack.\n\nUSB_ERROR(m, r) feeds r to libusb_strerror(r), which takes r as int. Do you know why we need this cast to libusb_error in first place?",
      "parentUuid": "f855f0cc_c1c38e54",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 225,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 225,
        "endChar": 40
      },
      "revId": "26856267e2b74110208aa8e9344700109e90b38a",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b505dedc_2edbb503",
        "filename": "util/comm-usb.c",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 225,
      "author": {
        "id": 1314845
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-09-19T17:43:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In C++, `int` and `enum` are distinct types, so there is no implicit conversion between the two like in C.",
      "parentUuid": "65894b3f_546c2fe5",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 225,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 225,
        "endChar": 40
      },
      "revId": "26856267e2b74110208aa8e9344700109e90b38a",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "0bd91300_ce8b76f2",
        "filename": "util/comm-usb.c",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 225,
      "author": {
        "id": 1314845
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-09-19T17:46:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh, I see what you are asking. It does look like [`libusb_strerror` takes `int`](https://libusb.sourceforge.io/api-1.0/group__libusb__misc.html#ga554ec46d5fbaa29e26a85036a3621e53), but looking at `/usr/lib/libusb.h` in the chroot, I see\n\n```\nconst char * LIBUSB_CALL libusb_strerror(enum libusb_error errcode);\n```\n\nMaybe we\u0027re using an old version of libusb?",
      "parentUuid": "b505dedc_2edbb503",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 225,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 225,
        "endChar": 40
      },
      "revId": "26856267e2b74110208aa8e9344700109e90b38a",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e594a2c5_d739a617",
        "filename": "util/comm-usb.c",
