      },
      "lineNbr": 225,
      "author": {
        "id": 1314845
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-09-19T17:52:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It looks like we are using [`1.0.22`](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/third_party/chromiumos-overlay/dev-libs/libusb/libusb-1.0.22.ebuild;drc\u003de3e6f5544f1767266c6438c045367d7fa80ce7e6), but the latest version is [`1.0.26`](https://github.com/libusb/libusb/releases).\n\nLooks like this was fixed in [this commit](https://github.com/libusb/libusb/commit/5d0d0a58ed3ea813200b83d69e28a3ea24e86f01), which was released in `1.0.24`.",
      "parentUuid": "0bd91300_ce8b76f2",
